      "content": "<div class=\"mm-release-marker\" data-mm-release=\"f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605\" data-mm-topic=\"t-mm-09-003\" hidden></div>\n<h3 class=\"mm-heading mm-h3 mm-header-banner\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15767]\" style=\"background-color: #9CC2E5; color: #FFFFFF; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 8pt; margin-bottom: 4pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt'>1.2.</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt'>CHICKEN POX IN PREGNANCY:</span></h3>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15768]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>3/1000.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15769]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Incubation period: </span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15770]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>1 \u2013 3 weeks.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15771]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Infecti</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>ous</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>: </span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15772]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>48 hours before Rash till vesicles crust over (within 5 days).</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15773]\" style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><u><strong>Varicella Zoster Contact: </strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15774]\" style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><u><strong>1. Signify contact</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15775]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><u><strong>Symptoms develops despite VZ IG or antiviral PEP</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Pt presents with chicken pox.</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>24 \u2013 48 hours.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Contact with GP</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Or midwife telephonic.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Avoid contact with </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>suspectable</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'> individuals.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><u><strong>Symptomatic treatment.</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>OFFER:</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Before 24 hours of rash</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Before 20 weeks.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Consider:</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>After 24 hours.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>After 20 weeks =&gt; symptomatic treatment only.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>      </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Avoid delivery for 7 days to reduce Neonatal risk.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>50% infection.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>23% clinical dis</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>ease</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Transfer </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>anti</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>bodies to fetus.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>less risk of </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>haemorrhage</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>, neonatal VZS.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Delivery within 7 days extremely hazardous.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Risk of transfer of virus with spinal needle.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Epidural is safe (as dura is not penetrated).</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Choose site with spared lesions.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>GA \u2013    es respiratory morbidity.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><strong>Infection before 28 weeks</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Inform risk of FVS \u2013 1%.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Refer to FMU @ (16 \u2013 20 weeks</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'> or </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'> after 5 weeks of infection).</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>USG</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Amino \u2013 PCR DNA</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>MRI if USG abnormal.</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15776]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><u><strong>No past history.</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Uncertain status.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Tropical/ sub \u2013 tropical</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><u><strong>Check Immune status.</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>IG \u2013 G status \u2013 (within 24 \u2013 48 hours). </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>From booking blood \u2013 (within 40 </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>min</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>).</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Ig \u2013 G +ve</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>ig \u2013 ve.</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><strong>   </strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><strong> PEP</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>1. Oral antiviral as 1</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><sup>st</sup></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'> line PEP</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Acyclovir, valaciclovir can be given from day 7-14</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>2.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>VZIG Given &lt;10 days:</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Of exposure.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Before rash in index case (if exposure is continuous).</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>If oral not tolerable or renal problem.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><u><strong>Explain The woman </strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>that they are infectious.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>D-8 \u2013 28 \u2013 if VZ immunoglobulins are given.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>D-8 \u2013 21 \u2013 if not given.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><u><strong>5.</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><u> </u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><u>Re \u2013 exposure:</u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>1.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'> Check VZ</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'> </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>igG again if negative then give  Oral PEP or immunoglobulin</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>2.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'> Re \u2013 dosing of VZ IG after 3 weeks.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><u><strong>Postpartum vaccination:</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>2 doses 4 \u2013 8 weeks apart.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Avoid pregnancy for 28 days (live Attenuated)</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Avoid contact with suspect</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>a</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>ble individuals.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><u><strong>2. past history of chicken pox.</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>99% predictive value</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Reassure, no Action.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><u><strong>Significance of contact:</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>15 min in same room.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Face to face 5 min.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Contact in large ward.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'> </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Herperzoster.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'> </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>If on exposed axes.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>If in immune \u2013 compromised Pts (ed viral sheding).</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15777]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15778]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15779]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15780]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15781]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15782]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 7pt'>Consider.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 7pt'>Oral Acyclovir. 800mg \u2013 5 times \u2013 7 days [857].</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15783]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15784]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15785]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15786]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15787]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 8pt'>If rash is within 1 \u2013 4 weeks of delivery</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15788]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15789]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15790]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15791]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15792]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15793]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15794]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15795]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15796]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15797]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15798]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 8pt'>good NPV but no positive predictive value.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15799]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15800]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15801]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>VZV: Human Herpesvirus 3:</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15802]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Maternal Effects.</strong></em></span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15803]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Pneumonia, hepatitis, encephalitis.</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15804]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Fetal </strong></em></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>varicella syndrome (</strong></em></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>FVS</strong></em></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>)</strong></em></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>:</strong></em></span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15805]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1.</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Eye defects.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15806]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2.</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Limb hypoplasia.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15807]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3.</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Neurological abnormalities.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15808]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4.</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Skin scarring. </span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15809]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>(VZV \u2013 reactivation).</span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15810]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5.</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Sphincter</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> dysfunction.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15811]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6.</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Cortical atrophy.</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15812]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Neonatal</strong></em></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>.</strong></em></span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15813]\" style=\"padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Neonatal varicella syndrome</strong></em></span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15814]\" style=\"padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Pneumonia </strong></em></span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15815]\" style=\"padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Sepsis</strong></em></span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15816]\" style=\"padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>meningitis</strong></em></span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15817]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Hospital Assessment:</strong></u></span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15818]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Neurological symptoms.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15819]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Respiratory symptoms \u2013 smoking + cough.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15820]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Haemorrhagic rash.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15821]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Immuno compromised taking steroids &gt; 3m</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><sup>0</sup></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15822]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>2</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><sup>nd</sup></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> half of pregnancy even without complication.</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15823]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15824]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Severe symptoms</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>hospital admission:</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15825]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15826]\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>- Isolation.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15827]\" style=\"margin-left: 108pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>- MDT</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15828]\" style=\"margin-left: 144pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>O</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>bstetrician</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15829]\" style=\"margin-left: 144pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>FM</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>U</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15830]\" style=\"margin-left: 144pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Neonatologist. </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15831]\" style=\"margin-left: 144pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Virologist.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15832]\" style=\"margin-left: 144pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15833]\" style=\"margin-left: 144pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15834]\" style=\"margin-left: 144pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15835]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u21e8</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>if delivery occurs within 7 days:</strong></u></span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15836]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Neonatal VZIG </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u>+</u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> Acyclovir.</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15837]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>For PEP</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15838]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>When neonate has rash =&gt; Acyclovir</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15839]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Maternal shingles @ delivery.</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15840]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Baby delivers.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15841]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15842]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>No IVIG required.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15843]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Maternal shingles P/P.</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15844]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15845]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15846]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Give IVIG</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15847]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15848]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15849]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15850]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15851]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15852]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15853]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15854]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15855]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15856]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15857]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-